        // Share sheet logic:
        // Wally + cpuNext=false: "Door X done"
        // Wally + cpuNext=true:  "Door X done" -> then "Door X CPU"
        // CPU   + cpuNext=true:  "Door X CPU" only (no "done" first)
        // Share sheet logic:
        // Wally + cpuNext=false: "Door X done"
